 have a correct solution","dna16":"8800111483000121","ex":["he loved to solve chessmate puzzles","that's a real puzzler"],"id":"oewn-puzzle__1.10.00..","pos":"noun","src":"wn","sym":"2:1,42:1,43:1","syn":["mystifier","puzzler","teaser"]},{"def":"a game that tests your ingenuity","dna16":"8800111483000220","ex":[],"id":"oewn-puzzle__1.06.00..","pos":"noun","src":"wn","sym":"","syn":[]},{"def":"be a mystery or bewildering to","dna16":"8800111483000329","ex":["This beats me!","Got me — I don't know the answer!"],"id":"oewn-puzzle__2.31.00..","pos":"verb","src":"wn","sym":"","syn":["amaze","baffle","beat","bewilder","dumbfound","flummox"]},{"def":"be uncertain about; think about without fully understanding or being able to decide","dna16":"8800111483000428","ex":["We puzzled over her sudden departure"],"id":"oewn-puzzle__2.37.03..","pos":"verb","src":"wn","sym":"25:1,45:1,66:1,120:1,124:1","syn":[]},{"def":"The state of feeling confused or mystified because one cannot understand a complicated matter, a problem, etc.; bewilderment, confusion; (countable) often in in a puzzle: an instance of this.","dna16":"8800111483000527","ex":[],"id":"wikt:puzzle:noun:5","pos":"noun","src":"wikt","sym":"18:1,32:1,38:1,43:1,63:1,66:1,67:1,106:1","syn":[],"tags":["uncountable"]},{"def":"A thing such as a complicated matter or a problem which is difficult to make sense of or understand; also, a person who is difficult to make sense of or understand; an enigma.","dna16":"8800111483000626","ex":["Where he went after he left the house is a puzzle."],"id":"wikt:puzzle:noun:6","pos":"noun","src":"wikt","sym":"0:1,2:2,12:1,43:1,63:1,66:2,106:2","syn":[],"tags":["countable"]},{"def":"Often preceded by a descriptive word: a game or toy, or a problem, requiring some effort to complete or work out, which is intended as a pastime and/or to test one's mental ability.","dna16":"8800111483000725","ex":["crossword puzzle    jigsaw puzzle"],"id":"wikt:puzzle:noun:7","pos":"noun","src":"wikt","sym":"2:1,